sequenceDiagram
  participant Vendor as Vendor
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as Database

  Vendor->>API: Login
  API->>DB: Verifikasi kredensial
  DB-->>API: Token JWT
  API-->>Vendor: Dashboard vendor

  Vendor->>API: Lihat pesanan masuk
  API->>DB: Query order by restoran
  DB-->>API: Daftar pesanan
  API-->>Vendor: Tampilkan pesanan

  Vendor->>API: Update status (PROCESSING)
  API->>DB: Update order
  DB-->>API: Sukses

  Vendor->>API: Update status (READY)
  API->>DB: Update order
  DB-->>API: Sukses

  Note over Vendor,DB: Customer diberitahu

  Vendor->>API: Update status (COMPLETED)
  API->>DB: Update order
  DB-->>API: Sukses
